sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Requester (Student/Staff)
  participant App as CampusServiceApp
  participant Mgr as ServiceRequestManager
  participant F as ServiceRequestFactory
  participant Req as ICTSupportRequest
  participant DS as CampusDataStore
  participant Repo as Repositories (JSON files)

  R->>App: Option 2 "Submit Service Request"
  App->>R: Ask user ID
  R-->>App: DWU2026001
  App->>Mgr: findUserById("DWU2026001")
  Mgr-->>App: StudentRequester
  App->>App: canSubmitRequests()?
  App->>R: Ask category, title, description, location, priority, specialised fields
  R-->>App: answers
  App->>Mgr: generateRequestId()
  Mgr-->>App: "REQ010"
  App->>F: create(commonData, specialisedData)
  F->>Req: new ICTSupportRequest(common, specialised)
  Req->>Req: super(common) validates base fields, status = Submitted
  Req->>Req: validateSpecialisedFields()
  alt invalid data
    Req-->>App: ValidationError
    App->>R: [ERROR] message (nothing saved)
  else valid
    F-->>App: request
    App->>Mgr: submitRequest(request)
    Mgr->>Mgr: validate, check requester, duplicate ID, status
    Mgr->>Mgr: requests.push(request), addAudit("Request Created")
    Mgr->>DS: saveRequests(requests)
    DS->>Repo: saveAll(serviceRequests.json, requestHistory.json)
    Mgr->>DS: saveAudit(auditLog)
    DS->>Repo: saveAll(auditLog.json)
    Mgr-->>App: request
    App->>Req: getRequestSummary()
    App->>R: [OK] Request REQ010 submitted + summary
  end
